{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36180","headline":"赠信州高员外 · 方干","name":"赠信州高员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"溪势盘回绕郡流，饶阳春色满溪楼。\n岂唯啼鸟催人醉，更有繁花笑客愁。\n蹇拙命中迷直道，仁慈风里驻扁舟。\n膺门若感深恩去，终杀微躯未足酬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36180.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36180","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}